[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:33. A Fine Day]
[00:00.320]Lesson 33|第33课
[00:02.475]It is a fine day today.|今天天气很好。
[00:05.970]There are some clouds in the sky, but the sun is shining.|天空中有些云，但太阳正在照耀。
[00:11.625]Mr. Jones is with his family.|琼斯先生和他的家人在一起。
[00:15.080]They are walking over the bridge.|他们正在过桥。
[00:18.390]There are some boats on the river.|河里有一些船。
[00:22.085]Mr. Jones and his wife are looking at them.|琼斯先生和他的妻子正在看着它们。
[00:26.985]Sally is looking at a big ship.|莎莉正在看一艘大船。
[00:31.125]The ship is going under the bridge.|船正在从桥下经过。
[00:35.220]Tim is looking at an aeroplane.|蒂姆正在看一架飞机。
[00:39.510]The aeroplane is flying over the river.|飞机正在河上飞行。